  "notes": "Phanpy Mastodon client. Profile page is overlaid on a hidden Home timeline (the DOM/a11y tree include the hidden timeline; full-page screenshot is mostly blank below y≈2400). Distinctive: banner illustration fades into the white profile card, large initials avatar with orange gold gradient, stats in a pale grey pill row, pinned posts break out of the 640px column into a full-width band with faded overflow and floating 'Read more →' pills. Posts are 32px-radius white cards without visible action rows; tiny orange heart/blue bookmark glyphs at top-right corners mark liked/saved. Boost header shows rocket icon + mini avatar 'boosted'. Circular royal-blue floating Compose button bottom-right with feather icon. 'The end.' marks end of timeline. 'View post stats' reveals a stacked bar (original/replies/boosts) on click."
